          "content": "A\n\n**Explanation:** \nWhen choosing without knowing your ultimate position, the most rational approach is to maximize overall expected well-being. Because the vast majority of individuals across nearly all levels enjoy a higher standard of living, the total aggregate welfare and opportunities for flourishing are substantially greater. The significantly higher probability of experiencing a more prosperous and fulfilling life outweighs the localized risk at the very bottom, resulting in the greatest net benefit for the population as a whole.",
